sequenceDiagram
  participant DB as DB / Gate 02
  participant W as Worker V2
  participant A as API V2
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant O as Observation
  DB->>DB: preflight + restore + migrate + validate
  DB-->>W: schema compatible
  W->>W: consume V1 and V2
  W-->>A: all target replicas Ready
  A->>A: rolling producer deployment
  A-->>S: API stable
  S->>S: idempotent singleton registration
  S-->>O: observe schema/runtime/backlog
  O-->>DB: cleanup only after zero old-version demand
